  "description": "Erection of cover over existing menage to serve existing equestrian use (Retrospective Application)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The height, width, depth and overall bulk, position, design and materiality of the canopy would be highly prominent and dominant and would fail to preserve the openness of the Green Belt. The proposed cover would introduce indoor use to the on-site facilities. The proposal is considered to represent inappropriate development which, by definition, is harmful to the Green Belt. No very special circumstances have been demonstrated that would clearly outweigh the harm to the Green Belt and, for these reasons, the development is considered contrary to paragraph 147, 148 and 149 of the NPPF (2023), Policy G2 of the London Plan (2021) and Policy CS3 of the RBK Core Strategy (2012)."
  ],
